\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces H4 training trajectory: FID (left axis, red) and R@1 (right axis, blue) across the late training segment. The best checkpoint is epoch\nobreakspace  {}3399 on \emph  {both} metrics; both then degrade monotonically through epoch\nobreakspace  {}4999. Training loss is flat across this range — sampling quality oscillates independently of training loss.\relax }}{8}{figure.caption.15}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:h4_training}{{3}{8}{H4 training trajectory: FID (left axis, red) and R@1 (right axis, blue) across the late training segment. The best checkpoint is epoch~3399 on \emph {both} metrics; both then degrade monotonically through epoch~4999. Training loss is flat across this range — sampling quality oscillates independently of training loss.\relax }{figure.caption.15}{}}
